{"id":"466c532d80d46a83","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-hbl-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate Defined by P1–P3","display":"df-hbl-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate Defined by P1–P3","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate","aliases":["92-df-hbl-provability-predicate"],"display":"df-hbl-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate Defined by P1–P3","source":"第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 123–124）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hbl-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate Defined by P1–P3"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 123–124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(B)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(B)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_BX\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\">\\(\\Box_BX\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 是下文定义的公式性质，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_B\">\\(\\Box_B\\)</span> 的输入是闭句、输出也是闭句。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hbl\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_B(X\\to Y)\\to(\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash(\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_B(\\Box_BX)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hbl\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_B(X\\to Y)\\to(\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash(\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_B(\\Box_BX)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书第 IX 章把这三个条件作为 provability predicate 的定义，不把“在标准模型中恰好表达可证码集”纳入定义。后者是正确性，须另验证。第一行是两个元语言判断之间的蕴涵；后两行是系统证明的对象语言句子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 无需预先为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书明确说明 P.A. 标准谓词满足 P3 的详证超出本书范围（p. 107）。不能从“证明关系可判定/可表示”或“正确于标准模型”直接声称 P2/P3 已证明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 123–124）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(B)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_BX\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hbl\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bigl(\\Box_B(X\\to Y)\\to(\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash(\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_B(\\Box_BX)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2033,"backlinks":[{"id":"a02811a5f1367e7a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HBL}_{G}(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)$，见[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]；这是所选公式的独立可导性条件。"},{"id":"553707b7a7425e75","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"所选 $\\mathrm{Prov}_G$ 满足 HBL 的 P1：$G\\vdash A$ 蕴涵 $G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner})$；见[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]。"},{"id":"5c268cc